Wayland: send the latest key press serial with the activation token (winit 0.30.13)

request_user_attention made an xdg-activation token without a serial, so GNOME only showed a
"window is ready" notification and did not move the focus. Remember the serial of the latest key press
and the surface that had the keyboard focus, and put both on the token.

